        sh:message "Every Device should, for each of its solid cylinder forms (cpo:SolidCylinderForm - its form or envelope form, or any cavity, part or layer below them), have its own Actual ProcessVariable for each of cpo:hasDiameter, cpo:hasHeight, cpo:hasOuterVolume, on every level. Which of them is missing is not named by the report - look at the forms of the device." ;
    ] .

